{"uuid":"db4618f6-121b-4c97-98d3-c29849c5824e","variant":"base","mode":"judged","verdict":"fail","notes":"Sampled (D21). As player, desktop and mobile: the ☾ activation raises a target prompt over exactly the two cards of the player's void, with in-viewport, hit-tested candidates; a reload mid-prompt restores it; the chosen event gains Reclaim (floating keyword change, tracer exhausted); the void chooser then offers 'Reclaim <card>' plus View Your Void and Cancel; reclaiming plays it for its 1● cost, marks it reclaimed and banishes it on resolution; the battle log reads the activation, the gain of Reclaim and the play; __caps empty. FAIL: the granted Reclaim has no indicator on the void card: the void browser shows no status badge and the void pile no marker or playable outline while a Reclaim play exists, so the grant is visible only in the log and by opening the void chooser. Fix bead: hv-umm2.371 (re-judges Memory Tracer and Speaker for the Forgotten). Cause outside this bead's areas: src/battle/components/EngineBattleScreen.tsx (browsedCards passes card models only, no statuses; the void pile shows no mark when affordances.voidPlays is non-empty) and src/cumulus/screens/CardZoneBrowserOverlay.tsx (renders no status badges); the same holds for printed Reclaim. Related: a granted 'Reclaim N●' cost (Speaker for the Forgotten) is not shown in the keyword badge or log line (src/runtime/battle-prompt-messages.ts keyword copy, src/screens/cumulus_adapters/engine-battle-view-model.ts keyword badge). As enemy (staged tracer and two void cards, 5●): the AI advanced the tracer to the front rank and did not activate it within two turns, so opponent-side follow-through was not observed; the sweep covers the enemy playing the card.","bead":"hv-umm2.78","commit":"ced8c781fa4618a77fe9a8f4454db003452c2e60","screens":["tracer-target-desktop.png","tracer-target-mobile.png","tracer-granted-desktop.png","tracer-granted-mobile.png","tracer-void-chooser-desktop.png","tracer-void-chooser-mobile.png","tracer-void-browser-desktop.png","tracer-void-browser-mobile.png","tracer-reclaimed-desktop.png","tracer-reclaimed-mobile.png","tracer-log-desktop.png","tracer-log-mobile.png","tracer-enemy-desktop.png","tracer-enemy-mobile.png","tracer-enemy-log-desktop.png","tracer-enemy-log-mobile.png"]}
